# Conclusion

These modifications transform the Raspberry Pi into a **reliable industrial telemetry gateway** capable of long-term continuous operation.

The system is now hardened against common Linux USB serial issues and sensor runtime failures that typically appear during extended deployments.

Further improvements may include:

